   "There are some changes to the training timetable for this term:\n\n- Monday sessions now start at 6pm instead of 5:30pm.\n- The Wednesday session moves to the smaller pool.\n- Saturday morning training continues as before.\n\nThe new times allow the coaches to give more attention to each group. Please check your child's group on the updated timetable, which has been posted on the club noticeboard.",
